From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Svensson <blue@cmd.nu>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 22:52:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] config interface breakout: new ports inherit mtu and fec

The ports that 'config interface breakout' adds get the highest mtu of the
ports it deletes, and the fec of the first deleted port (in lane order)
whose fec is set and not 'none'. Without an active fec on any deleted port,
a new port keeps the fec from platform.json (rs for 50G+ per lane) or gets
'none'. Without an mtu on any deleted port, the new ports get no mtu.

kamelnetworks/sonic-buildimage#197
